column151:
28/Oct/21 8:07 PM;557058:443ab871-4096-403e-bd6f-f3534fe417f0;When this is deployed, we need to pick a weekday, any weekday (Support request, not technical requirement), and reindex tags on production using {{bundle exec rake autocomplete:reload_tag_data}}

While this is ongoing, we should have a yellow banner up that says:

{quote}We are refreshing our tag autocomplete data, which is used to suggest tags when posting and searching works. While this is ongoing, the tag autocomplete will be incomplete. Don't panic\! <strong>*All tags will be back when we're done.*</strong>{quote}

ETA: I’ve added the banner on the admin side, so we just need to activate it when the time comes.

