column126:
10/Mar/12 7:48 PM;557058:c714f0f0-b42d-45c7-be2f-d002135599e4;The actual error will be triggered by any validation error causing the update to fail
- the problem is that we're setting instance variables in the edit action that we're
not setting in the update action before we render the edit view. We need this bit:


      @pseuds = current_user.pseuds
      @coauthors = @series.pseuds.select{ |p| p.user.id != current_user.id}
      to_select = @series.pseuds.blank? ? [current_user.default_pseud] : @series.pseuds
      @selected_pseuds = to_select.collect {|pseud| pseud.id.to_i }
